xgrammar C++ core, vendored verbatim for pulsar L303 (grammar-constrained decoding).

upstream: https://github.com/mlc-ai/xgrammar  (Apache-2.0; LICENSE and NOTICE beside this file)
pin:      b319ac9f908e2c7f2bde6086c108c70f82f526c6  (v0.2.8+25, 2026-10-28)
dlpack:   bbd2f4d32427e548797929af08cfe2a9cbb3cf12  (3rdparty/dlpack/dlpack.h only; Apache-2.0, LICENSE beside it)
picojson: as carried by xgrammar's 3rdparty/picojson (BSD-2-Clause, in the header)

Copied from the pinned upstream clone, no edits:
  include/                                -> include/
  cpp/*.cc cpp/*.h                        -> cpp/
  cpp/support/                            -> cpp/support/
  cpp/converter_ext/                      -> cpp/converter_ext/
  3rdparty/picojson/picojson.h            -> 3rdparty/picojson.h
  3rdparty/dlpack/include/dlpack/dlpack.h -> 3rdparty/dlpack/dlpack.h
Not copied: cpp/tvm_ffi (the Python binding), python/, web/, tests/, cpptrace, googletest.

Build flags (Makefile, GRAMMAR_CXXFLAGS): -fexceptions, no -ffast-math, -Wno-unused-parameter.
The only caller is src/lib/pulsar_grammar.cpp (the exception boundary).
